var SEARCH_INDEX=[{"u": "about-us.html", "t": "About Us", "x": "About Us For it is by grace you have been saved, through faith—and this is not from yourselves, it is the gift of God—not by works, so that no one can boast. Ephesians 2:8-9 Grace Bible Church is a local congregation in RC Puram, Hyderabad. We teach the Bible, we pray together, and we hold out the gospel of grace to our neighbours and to the nations. Our Mission Why we exist: to know Christ, grow in His Word and carry His grace to every home in our city and to the nations. Learn more What We Believe The Bible, the gospel of grace and the life of the church, in short statements with Scripture. Learn more Our Pastor Pastor T. Rajesh and how he shepherds the church. Learn more Mission Work How the church gives, prays and goes: village outreach, Bibles and literature, care and compassion. Learn more Visit Us What to expect on your first Sunday, and how to find us. Learn more Become a part of our family You are welcome here, whatever your story. Come on Sunday, join our daily Bible reading, or send us a message. Find the church WhatsApp us"}, {"u": "beliefs.html", "t": "What We Believe", "x": "What We Believe All Scripture is God-breathed and is useful for teaching, rebuking, correcting and training in righteousness, so that the servant of God may be thoroughly equipped for every good work. 2 Timothy 3:16-17 The Bible The Bible is the inspired Word of God and our final authority for faith and life. God There is one God, eternally existing as Father, Son and Holy Spirit. Jesus Christ Jesus Christ is the Son of God. He died on the cross for our sins, rose bodily from the dead, and will return. Salvation by grace We are saved by grace through faith in Christ alone, not by our works. It is the gift of God. The Holy Spirit The Holy Spirit gives new life to believers, dwells in them, and empowers them to live and witness for Christ. The Church The church is the body of Christ: believers gathered to worship, pray, learn the Word, and carry the gospel to the world."}, {"u": "books.html", "t": "Books We Are Reading", "x": "Books We Are Reading Until I come, devote yourself to the public reading of Scripture, to preaching and to teaching. 1 Timothy 4:13 Men’s Meeting The Measure of a Man by Gene A. Getz 1st and 3rd Wednesday, 6:00 PM Friday Book Reading 10 Qualities of a Healthy Church Member by C. Stephen David Every Friday, 6:30 PM Back to Resources"}, {"u": "giving.html", "t": "Giving", "x": "Giving Each of you should give what you have decided in your heart to give, not reluctantly or under compulsion, for God loves a cheerful giver. 2 Corinthians 9:7 Your offering carries the gospel further Tithes and offerings support worship, the poor and our missionary work. Scan the code with any UPI app such as PhonePe, Google Pay, Paytm or BHIM, and check that the name shows GRACE BIBLE CHURCH before you pay. QR919347873792-2199@unionbankofindia Copy UPI ID"}, {"u": "index.html", "t": "Grace Bible Church, RC Puram, Hyderabad", "x": "Welcome to Grace Bible Church To know Christ, grow in His Word, and carry His grace to every home in our city and to the nations. A local congregation in RC Puram, Hyderabad, where the Bible is open, prayer is constant and every person is known by name. Plan your visit About us Next gathering Sunday Worship Sunday at 10:00 AM IST About our church Grace Bible Church is a family of believers, saved by grace and sent in love. Read our story, our mission and what we believe. Learn more Recent messages Watch the Sunday messages and teachings of Pastor T. Rajesh on our YouTube channel, and read reflections on the blog. Watch and read Weekly gatherings Daily Bible reading, Sunday worship, prayer meetings, men’s and women’s meetings, and a monthly night of prayer. See the weekly schedule Come and see us BHEL LIG, RC Puram, Hyderabad. Pastor T. Rajesh and the welcome team will greet you at the door. Come as you are. Get directions Verse of the day The LORD is my shepherd, I lack nothing. Psalm 23:1 Mark your calendar Special meetings From the church office Church news Our pastor Pastor T. Rajesh Shepherding Grace Bible Church with the Word and with prayer. Come and meet him after any Sunday worship. Meet our pastor Wherever you are Join the family online Pray and read the Word with us on Zoom, watch our messages on YouTube, or send us a message on WhatsApp. Online resources Give generously"}, {"u": "location.html", "t": "Location", "x": "Location How lovely is your dwelling place, LORD Almighty! Psalm 84:1 Find the church Address Grace Bible Church BHEL LIG, RC Puram Hyderabad 502032 Phone +91 93478 73792 Email gracebiblechurch@gmail.com Sunday Sunday School 9:00 AM Worship 10:00 AM Open in Maps WhatsApp"}, {"u": "men.html", "t": "Men's Meeting", "x": "Men’s Meeting As iron sharpens iron, so one person sharpens another. Proverbs 27:17 Men of all ages gather for the Word, honest conversation and prayer for their homes, work and witness. What we do Bible study and testimony Prayer for families and workplaces Serving the church and neighbourhood When Every 1st and 3rd Wednesday, 6:00 PM, at the church hall. Now reading The Measure of a Man by Gene A. Getz. Back to Ministries"}, {"u": "ministries.html", "t": "Ministries", "x": "Ministries And let us consider how we may spur one another on toward love and good deeds, not giving up meeting together, as some are in the habit of doing, but encouraging one another. Hebrews 10:24-25 Weekly Gatherings Every gathering at a glance: daily Bible reading, Sunday worship, prayer, men’s and women’s meetings. Learn more Prayer Meetings Come, let us pray together: every day, every Wednesday and the last Friday night. Learn more Men’s Meeting Iron sharpens iron. Every 1st and 3rd Wednesday. Learn more Women’s Fellowship Strength and dignity. Every 2nd Saturday. Learn more Missionary Work Go and make disciples: village outreach, Bibles and literature, care and compassion. Learn more"}, {"u": "mission.html", "t": "Our Mission", "x": "Our Mission Therefore go and make disciples of all nations, baptizing them in the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit, and teaching them to obey everything I have commanded you. Matthew 28:19-20 To know Christ, grow in His Word, and carry His grace to every home in our city and to the nations. The Word We teach the Bible book by book and live under its authority. Grace We are saved by grace through faith, and we extend that same grace to others. Prayer Every week begins and ends on our knees, together and in our homes. Fellowship Men, women, youth and children grow side by side as one family. Mission We give, pray and go so that villages and cities hear the gospel."}, {"u": "missions.html", "t": "Missionary Work", "x": "Missionary Work And how can anyone preach unless they are sent? As it is written: “How beautiful are the feet of those who bring good news!” Romans 10:15 Our church supports the gospel beyond our walls through prayer, giving and going. Missionary Outreach meets on the third Sunday of each month at 2:00 PM, after worship. Village outreach Teams travel to nearby villages to share the gospel, pray with families and hold children’s programmes. Bibles and literature Scriptures and gospel tracts are placed in homes and shared in the languages people read. Care and compassion Food, medicine and encouragement for families in need, shown in the name of Christ. Missionaries we support We stand with missionaries and church planters through monthly giving, letters and prayer. Pray for the mission field Open doors and open hearts in every village we visit Safety and strength for our missionaries and their families Workers for the harvest from our own congregation New believers to be discipled and rooted in the Word Back to Ministries"}, {"u": "pastor.html", "t": "Our Pastor", "x": "Our Pastor Be shepherds of God’s flock that is under your care, watching over them—not because you must, but because you are willing, as God wants you to be. 1 Peter 5:2 Pastor T. Rajesh Pastor T. Rajesh shepherds Grace Bible Church with the Word and with prayer. He teaches the Bible book by book, leads the daily Bible reading, and shares messages and reflections online. Meet him After any Sunday worship, 10:00 AM YouTube youtube.com/@rajeshinsights Blog rajeshinsights.blogspot.com Contact +91 93478 73792"}, {"u": "prayer.html", "t": "Prayer Meetings", "x": "Prayer Meetings Pray continually. 1 Thessalonians 5:17 The church that prays together stays together. Join us every day, every Wednesday and on the last Friday night. Daily Bible Reading Every morning, 6:00 to 6:30 AM. Wednesday Prayer Every Wednesday at 7:00 PM. All Night Prayer The last Friday of every month, starting at 10:00 PM. Need prayer? Send your request to the church by WhatsApp or email , and we will pray with you. Back to Ministries"}, {"u": "resources.html", "t": "Resources", "x": "Resources Your word is a lamp for my feet, a light on my path. Psalm 119:105 Messages on YouTube Our channel Respondtothetruth carries messages and teachings by Pastor T. Rajesh. Visit the channel Blog Articles and reflections at rajeshinsights.blogspot.com. Read the blog Books We Are Reading Men’s Meeting and Friday Book Reading. Learn more Join on Zoom Daily Bible reading and online gatherings: meeting ID and passcode. Learn more Prayer Requests Send a request by WhatsApp and the church will pray with you. Message us"}, {"u": "schedule.html", "t": "Weekly Gatherings", "x": "Weekly Gatherings The LORD has done it this very day; let us rejoice today and be glad. Psalm 118:24 All times are Indian Standard Time. Gathering When Time Daily Bible Reading Read and pray through the Word together. Every day 6:00 to 6:30 AM Sunday School For children and adults. Sundays 9:00 AM Sunday Worship Worship, prayer and the preaching of the Word. Sundays 10:00 AM Missionary Outreach After worship; village outreach and mission prayer. 3rd Sunday 2:00 PM Men’s Meeting Currently reading The Measure of a Man by Gene A. Getz. 1st and 3rd Wednesday 6:00 PM Wednesday Prayer Meeting Corporate prayer for the church and city. Wednesdays 7:00 PM Book Reading Currently reading 10 Qualities of a Healthy Church Member by C. Stephen David. Fridays 6:30 PM All Night Prayer A night of prayer together. Last Friday 10:00 PM Women’s Fellowship Bible study, worship in song and prayer. 2nd Saturday 4:00 PM Meeting online? Join the daily Bible reading on Zoom . ← Back to Ministries"}, {"u": "visit.html", "t": "Visit Us", "x": "Visit Us I rejoiced with those who said to me, “Let us go to the house of the LORD.” Psalm 122:1 When Sunday School is at 9:00 AM and Sunday Worship at 10:00 AM. Who you will meet Pastor T. Rajesh and the welcome team will greet you at the door. Come as you are. Where BHEL LIG, RC Puram, Hyderabad 502032. Map and directions"}, {"u": "women.html", "t": "Women's Fellowship", "x": "Women’s Fellowship She is clothed with strength and dignity; she can laugh at the days to come. Proverbs 31:25 Women meet to study Scripture, encourage one another and pray for the church, children and the sick. What we do Bible study and worship in song Visiting the sick and the lonely Mothers’ prayer for the next generation When Second Saturday of every month, 4:00 PM, at the church hall. Back to Ministries"}, {"u": "zoom.html", "t": "Join on Zoom", "x": "Join on Zoom For where two or three gather in my name, there am I with them. Matthew 18:20 Join the daily Bible reading and our online gatherings from anywhere. Meeting ID 862 1217 7632 Copy Passcode 777 Copy Open Zoom Back to Resources"}];
